            "pages": {
              "end": 17,
              "start": 17
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Appeals Council dismissed the petitioner's request for review as untimely, and this dismissal was a final decision that made the agency's denial of benefits conclusive and binding."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3b8170245086fc9eaea9e37f16a125b58aa335ebb3246bca6d6ebcdce0afa1e0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3b8170245086-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 17,
              "start": 17
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The United States (amicus) argues that the Appeals Council\u2019s dismissal order is a final agency action, leaving no further agency work to be done."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Huston",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3b8170245086fc9eaea9e37f16a125b58aa335ebb3246bca6d6ebcdce0afa1e0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3b8170245086-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Huston, the petitioner alleges that the agency misapplied its timeliness regulation in this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Gupta",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3b8170245086fc9eaea9e37f16a125b58aa335ebb3246bca6d6ebcdce0afa1e0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3b8170245086-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner states that about 22,000 cases each year are never reviewable."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Gupta",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3b8170245086fc9eaea9e37f16a125b58aa335ebb3246bca6d6ebcdce0afa1e0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3b8170245086-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that the only appropriate remedy is a remand."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3b8170245086fc9eaea9e37f16a125b58aa335ebb3246bca6d6ebcdce0afa1e0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3b8170245086-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to United States, the United States (amicus) notes that the agency\u2019s decision was conclusive and that the agency had held a hearing before an administrative law judge on the petitioner\u2019s application."
      }
    ],
